  <SpawnTable>k__BackingField: 6
  <BestiaryNodeText>k__BackingField: 'Yuleman


    Sigurd''s danger level: A++


    Scientific
    name: SCP-4666


    It seems that scp 4666 has taken a liking into visiting
    moons and abducting kids, he seems to only target people who have witnessed him
    kidnapping a child, if he is not seen he will not attack, but as soon as someone
    does see him he will start chasing them to the end of the earth to kill them,
    or if they are a child kidnap them, he is wielding a kind of magical knife he
    can throw and recall as he pleases, he does also seem to use a kind of teleport
    ability to confuse his target or to follow them into buildings.


    It does
    seem that it is possible to take him down with enough force.'
  <BestiaryWordOverride>k__BackingField: 
